<title>USA: Baxter says FTC seeks more information on purchase.</title>
<headline>Baxter says FTC seeks more information on purchase.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baxter International Inc said Friday the Federal Trade Commission has requested additional information and documentary material regarding its planned acquisition of Immuno International AG.</p>
<p>The request was made under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrust Improvements Act.</p>
</text>
